aid_01_21","text":"I just...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_01_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_01_22","text":"realized something.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_01_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_01_23","text":"Taking a full-body selfie...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_01_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_01_24","text":"kinda makes me self-conscious.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_01_25","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_01_25","text":"What do you mean?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_01_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_01_26","text":"Hear me out.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_01_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_01_27","text":"This outfit is so revealing.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_01_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_01_28","text":"Any photo I take will exist forever, won't it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_01_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_01_29","text":"Even if it's you who I'm sending it to,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_01_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_01_30","text":"I still am a bit nervous about the whole thing...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_01_31","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_01_31","text":"Does being a pirate make you embarrassed?","jump":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_01_33"},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_01_32","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_m